{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the depths of space, establish settlements, mine diverse resources, develop your economy, build fleets, and conquer the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010360/extras/a553a56136d350817de97a1d63221f6b.avif?t=1751387896\" width=624 height=204 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b\u200bAutomated Turn-Based Strategy: Focus on critical decisions while the game handles tedious processes through its automated turn-based system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010360/extras/d6981bb398f0e97dace26d1f7a6bd538.avif?t=1751387896\" width=624 height=204 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200bMulti-Fleet Exploration: Dispatch multiple fleets for automated exploration to uncover hidden wonders in the cosmic void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010360/extras/7be8d6f890e0a4755fa2d9b3b2acfa58.avif?t=1751387896\" width=624 height=204 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200bReal-Time Tactical Combat\u200b\u200b: Command fleets against formidable foes in real-time battles, with options to pause, accelerate, or decelerate combat for strategic planning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010360/extras/a54783a82520523d4d3a214683b26ecb.avif?t=1751387896\" width=624 height=204 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200bSquad-Based Warfare\u200b\u200b: Organize warships into specialized squads with distinct roles. Achieve victory through strategic positioning, tactical formation setups, and surprise maneuvers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010360/extras/901996e437fc01bc5c30b35cdb297874.avif?t=1751387896\" width=624 height=204 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can interact with structures on the map. By allocating human resources, constructing warships, engaging in trade, executing missions, and other methods, they can accumulate strength and build up their forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010360/extras/c5e5e97182835de0ceb3597c77bc9ac3.avif?t=1751387896\" width=624 height=204 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The developers describe how their game uses AI Generated Content like this:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To better focus on the core design of the game, some of our portraits and scene, were produced through a process involving drafts by artists, AI-assisted rendering, and adjustments by artists. Moreover, to ensure the final artistic presentation, all AI-generated assets have been manually refined by the artists.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2010360?t=1751387896","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010360/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751387896","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010360/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751387896","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010360/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751387896","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"i