g?t=1751387896","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010360/ss_e6feee76429534a4b784bfb74b75038eb8842576.600x338.jpg?t=1751387896"},{"id":10,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010360/ss_eb8d58ad46213b9ba389302d96f93918e10619c3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1751387896","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010360/ss_eb8d58ad46213b9ba389302d96f93918e10619c3.600x338.jpg?t=1751387896"},{"id":11,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010360/ss_64cd1a85dda43f7e38fe9b7414a157e8fbb7d380.1920x1080.jpg?t=1751387896","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010360/ss_64cd1a85dda43f7e38fe9b7414a157e8fbb7d380.600x338.jpg?t=1751387896"}],"short_description":"In this game, you are a leader, leading a force of army to fight other forces in the deep spaces. You will plunder their resources, build your homelands, explore and expand, managing your army both strategically and tactically. This will be a saga written with blood and fire.","steam_appid":2010360,"support_info":{"email":"unchartedgames_10086@hotmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"Simplified Chinese, English","type":"game","website":null}